    <item><headword id="d0e304" type="heading" level="h1">4. Faclan sam bith eile co-cheangailte ri pìobaireachd</headword></item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp109333720">pìobaireachd</headword>
      <description>on its own does not mean you play ‘ceòl mór’ [q.v.]. Would need to add that you were – ‘a’ pìobaireachd ceòl mór’.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp109335232">canntaireachd</headword>
